Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat and get your strength back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine! Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come I have to \Ntake care of this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, does it still hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I get some medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's his condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't listen to\Nwhat we tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We helped him out before, and then he ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:52.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who carry Ishbalan blood\Nare protected by our god, Ishbala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything has happened by God's direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NAren't you going at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the reason\Nyou hired me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to cut through their flesh\Nand splatter their blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, kill them!\NLeave no one alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is God bestowing upon us\Nyet another trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not the will of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the karmic doing of despicable men!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't!\NNot in your condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier in Resembool, there was something you were about to tell me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something you were too afraid to say to me till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was that my soul and\Nmemories and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are really something fake that you came up with, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What Ed wanted\Nto say to you was—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you, Brother?! Answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:36.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(3090,3570,\1c&HEEEEEB&,\3c&HEEEEEB&,\4c&HEEEEEB&)}Why don't you say anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, why didn't you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm nothing more than memories that Brother made up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. And then I told her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My memories of being with Mom could be fake too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sneaky thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want any!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stealing things from a store out of the blue—\Nif Mom knew we were doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see?\NTake it easy on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't steal other people's things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? This pile of junk spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a pile of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are you guys from Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope, I don't know\Nanything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:24.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, in any event, we have to find Al and \Ntalk things over thoroughly with him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:33.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to ask Al\Nsomething for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid to\Ntalk to him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(2400,2940,\1c&HFFFFFF&,\3c&HFFFFFF&,\4c&HFFFFFF&)}He... for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:49.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think there are things you have to talk about, or you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must think it unusual that \Nwe'd be living in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who\Nfollowed along on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, I hear you looked after these children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, you have\Na most peculiar outfit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can relax.\NHe is not a military person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We meet again,\NAlphonse Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that\Nyou're here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.19,0:07:53.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...\Nsomewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, this works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visitor, I'd like for you\Nnot to tell anyone about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know about Ishbal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why has it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military folks\Ncame and attacked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the past, they used every means\Nthey got their hands on to slaughter us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But apparently, it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:29.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I despise all State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:32.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're going to kill me,\Nthere's no better time than now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone! Mom's locket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any difference, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's when I lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See here! You cannot go outside again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick! Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric,\NI don't know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you and your brother hate each other,\Nthen it works out well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do you think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After talking to me, do you... do you sense anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean about me! In this body, do you think I'm human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:52.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. Ishbalans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick, give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NYes. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Continue tailing them and locate their nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it's a memento\Nof your late mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's inside of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. It won't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't talk that way\Nabout your mother's keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That woman...\NYou call her a mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All she ever did was force religious precepts on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was never once kind to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was just thinking of what was best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't care\Nwhat happened to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does this boy want to forget his entire past?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the complete opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to get my memories back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My real memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Al-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you?\NWhat are you about to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they're mercenaries, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're using a military installation on the outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick should be there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still, Scar-san, are you sure\Nthis is all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're about to go fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have a problem with us\Ngoing together with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people of Ishbal value\Nblood relations more than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it means saving Rick, then they can have the life of this old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:13:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is something important to the people of Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,our mom...\Nabandoned us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A phone call from Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. It sounded like he'd stuck\Nhis nose into something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that horrendous day for Ishbal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom was offering up prayers to Ishbala, \Njust like she always did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was no need for Rick to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would protect Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get a load of reward money from the military for this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to take it easy for a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got one of the kids, just like we were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we be sure\Nthe group will be coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know it.\NThese folks are tightly united.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as we can lure out\Nthe armored guy and the scarred man...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An alchemist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And there's the scarred man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys take the armored guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Little Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go pulling out all the stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, you don't exist.\NYou're just created memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you won't \Nhave to worry anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about whether or not\Nyour memories are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:15:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were worried sick\Nand came looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! I've been too afraid\Nto ask you for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you blame me?! It's my fault that you wound up in that body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why... That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering...\Nif you blamed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... That's what\Nyou wanted to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... How could I... How could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:52.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,blame you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, even that fabled man can fail to kill someone when he's in enough pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot him! Somebody get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give up.\NYou're the only one left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same as you,\Na dog of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dog of the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a State Alchemist?! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:18:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a State Alchemist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For putting me in this body, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:49.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick! Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is eye medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother's eyes\Nmust have been ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she didn't want to worry you,\Nso she pretended that she could still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she said she wasn't able to do enough for her children because of her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But on the inside, it must have been considerably harder for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She couldn't see.\NThen...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leo! Rick! Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:20:01.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was looking for us\Nand went into the children's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I was hired by the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:18.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why was there a State Alchemist getting in our way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you say something—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are others who make their way\Nwhile avoiding pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we shall go visit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm going to go on living, holding memories of my mother dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, too, am going to hold my memories.\NReally... hold them as real memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier,\NI saw something in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tears that you couldn't see in your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar! Tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you, the people of Ishbala, have a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which the military was after?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to protect ourselves from being destroyed by the military that was after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So did you make one?\NA Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get us underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:41.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those people need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, we always argued over the dumbest things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.59,0:22:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, like who had top or bottom of the bunk beds, and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I lost that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when we fought over toys, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We fought over candy too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.89,0:22:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I never did win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.72,0:23:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 25: "Words of Farewell"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll leave without telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what we've always done.
